[[JaxMas] FIGCHAPTERS]
  Items discussed: ForthNet -> UseNet porter discovers Forth, Forth Syntax,
  Ada the greedy, closures, SmallTalk/PostScript/Forth comparisons/asides,
  is FIG becomming a last man club ? a province of E.S. programmers with no
  voice ? Where is Forth's tomorrow ? More on X3/J14, Elizabeth Rather 1/18/90.
